      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s courthouse, finished in 1890, and the 1888 jail now on the National Register of Historic Places are key historic landmarks.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
